    "title": "",
    "legend": "The tumour shows a multinodular growth pattern, with fibrous septation and infiltration of adjacent adipose tissue. Perineural invasion is focally noted. Tumour nests range from membranous with hyaline droplets to solid, and they show prominent peripheral palisading of a dark cell layer. Centrally, squamous differentiation and scattered ducts are noted.",
